<title>USA: INTERVIEW - Medtronic backs FY 1997 range.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW - Medtronic backs FY 1997 range.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medtronic Inc Chairman and Chief Executive William George on Tuesday said the company was comfortable with analysts' fiscal 1997 earnings estimates of $2.22 to $2.30 per share.</p>
<p>The company earned $1.81 per share in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;I think we'll be in the range,&quot; George said in an interview with Reuters, referring to the range of analysts' forecasts in a First Call survey.</p>
</text>
